cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this formalization and the accompanying article when using these proofs."
type: software
title: "Lean formalization of the ambient Jung bound in dimensions 4k+1"
authors:
  - family-names: "Li"
    given-names: "Xiao"
abstract: >-
  A Lean formalization of the ambient Jung upper bound in every dimension
  4k+1 for k at least one, including arbitrary nonempty sets of real points
  and an explicit sharpness witness in dimension five.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal proof
  - Jung constant
  - Manhattan distance
  - cut metric
